    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"598432\">@Slava Tykhonov</span> thanks for the interesting presentation today on <a href=\"https://ai.codata.org\">https://ai.codata.org</a> ! I <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/dataverse-community/c/oMAFgE9279A/m/J-iQHdamAQAJ\">posted</a> the recording and your slides on DataverseTV.</p>\n<p>Thanks also for the external tool <a href=\"https://github.com/codata/semantic-croissant/blob/fb56de50ab1d48ea2dbc81f22f4e22af231af520/manifest.json\">manifest file</a> for <a href=\"http://ai.codata.org\">ai.codata.org</a> (Ghostwriter 2.0), which I just added to <a href=\"https://demo.dataverse.org\">https://demo.dataverse.org</a> in the <a href=\"https://guides.dataverse.org/en/6.12/admin/external-tools.html#adding-external-tools-to-a-dataverse-installation\">usual way</a>:</p>\n<p><code>curl -X POST -H 'Content-type: application/json' http://localhost:8080/api/admin/externalTools --upload-file manifest.json</code></p>",
        "id": 629661286,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1791318578
    },
    {
