    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"598432\">@Slava Tykhonov</span> ok, but am I using the tool wrong? I guess I was wondering if it could behave like <a href=\"https://github.com/IQSS/askdataverse\">AskTheData</a>, which can operate on data files, tabular files, spreadsheets.</p>",
        "id": 629846312,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1791378894
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Basically, I'm looking for a story to tell that starts like this:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>From a dataset page, click \"Access Dataset\" and then \"Ghostwriter 2.0\".</li>\n<li>You're now at <a href=\"https://ai.codata.org\">https://ai.codata.org</a> with the dataset metadata loaded.</li>\n<li>... (now what?)</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 629847840,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1791379182
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-07 at 16.59.04.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2988x1448\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/53090/YMJzNUK0Ba6vj5hdJ_uKsSfK/Screenshot-2026-10-07-at-16.59.04.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/53090/YMJzNUK0Ba6vj5hdJ_uKsSfK/Screenshot-2026-10-07-at-16.59.04.png/840x560.webp\"> Can you try now? It's connected.</p>",
