    {
        "content": "<p>Sounds fine! No rush! Great tool! <img alt=\":dataverse_man:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://avatars.zulip.com/53090/emoji/images/c7b94a03.png\" title=\"dataverse man\"></p>",
        "id": 630002530,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1791420873
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Deployed on Ask Dataverse now: <a href=\"https://ask.dataverse.org/vault/doc/w3xU4QkBNjnrQLz4yCiYRQ\">https://ask.dataverse.org/vault/doc/w3xU4QkBNjnrQLz4yCiYRQ</a><br>\nAnd look, it can run Agentic AI, download files and respond to questions!<br>\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-08 at 14.04.09.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"2124x1488\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/53090/cR6cKNgyWZvs6g3qF9K_4CSA/Screenshot-2026-10-08-at-14.04.09.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/53090/cR6cKNgyWZvs6g3qF9K_4CSA/Screenshot-2026-10-08-at-14.04.09.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
