    {
        "content": "<p>Sure! What should we call it? <span aria-label=\"thinking\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f914\" role=\"img\" title=\"thinking\">:thinking:</span> I'm not so sure about Ghostwriter...</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-06 at 4.38.00 PM.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"305x281\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/53090/Lg5mR5_H9Gw-Og0ORH-DvXct/Screenshot-2026-10-06-at-4.38.00PM.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/53090/Lg5mR5_H9Gw-Og0ORH-DvXct/Screenshot-2026-10-06-at-4.38.00PM.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"600327\">@Ceilyn Boyd</span> and I were joking that it should have an animal name. Ferret or Honeybadger or something. That way, it could do anything! Limitless features!</p>",
